{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p004430","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p004430"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p004430","label":"勸公子忘功客未名（魏公子列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"客","mention_ids":["c-shiji-077-weigong:m010-0092"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m010-0092","chapter_id":"c-shiji-077-weigong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:p010","quote":"客"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-077-weigong","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-077","chapter_id":"c-shiji-077-weigong","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-077-weigong:m010-0092"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-077-weigong:p010"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-077-weigong"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m010-0092","start":92,"end":93,"surface":"客","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004430","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:p010","chapter_id":"c-shiji-077-weigong"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji077-020","person_id":"cbr-p004430","surfaces":["客"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-077-weigong"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:p010","quote":"魏王怒公子之盜其兵符，矯殺晉鄙，公子亦自知也。已卻秦存趙，使將將其軍歸魏，而公子獨與客留趙。趙孝成王德公子之矯奪晉鄙兵而存趙，乃與平原君計，以五城封公子。公子聞之，意驕矜而有自功之色。客有說公子曰：「物有不可忘，或有不可不忘。夫人有德於公子，公子不可忘也；公子有德於人，願公子忘之也。且矯魏王令，奪晉鄙兵以救趙，於趙則有功矣，於魏則未為忠臣也。公子乃自驕而功之，竊為公子不取也。」於是公子立自責，似若無所容者。趙王埽除自迎，執主人之禮，引公子就西階。公子側行辭讓，從東階上。自言罪過，以負於魏，無功於趙。趙王侍酒至暮，口不忍獻五城，以公子退讓也。公子竟留趙。趙王以鄗為公子湯沐邑，魏亦復以信陵奉公子。公子留趙。"}],"rationale":"按全17段明示姓名與局部敘事暫接；侯嬴侯生嬴、無忌公子信陵君各限定本傳。如姬父與仇人未名，毛薛二公不補姓名。救邯鄲趙王按下一段孝成王明稱暫接，田獵趙王與後期秦王、大梁被虜魏王另存未名候選。偽賀魏王指擬立無忌不作授王，魏公子兵法作書名；泛稱夫人有德、軍令父子兄弟不補親屬。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:p010","text":"魏王怒公子之盜其兵符，矯殺晉鄙，公子亦自知也。已卻秦存趙，使將將其軍歸魏，而公子獨與客留趙。趙孝成王德公子之矯奪晉鄙兵而存趙，乃與平原君計，以五城封公子。公子聞之，意驕矜而有自功之色。客有說公子曰：「物有不可忘，或有不可不忘。夫人有德於公子，公子不可忘也；公子有德於人，願公子忘之也。且矯魏王令，奪晉鄙兵以救趙，於趙則有功矣，於魏則未為忠臣也。公子乃自驕而功之，竊為公子不取也。」於是公子立自責，似若無所容者。趙王埽除自迎，執主人之禮，引公子就西階。公子側行辭讓，從東階上。自言罪過，以負於魏，無功於趙。趙王侍酒至暮，口不忍獻五城，以公子退讓也。公子竟留趙。趙王以鄗為公子湯沐邑，魏亦復以信陵奉公子。公子留趙。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m010-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"魏王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004413","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m010-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m010-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"晉鄙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004425","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m010-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m010-0029","start":29,"end":34,"surface":"使將將其軍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、未定角色或泛稱保存，不補成員、姓名與親屬；擬立王及書名不當實際爵位授予。"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m010-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m010-0042","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"客留趙","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、未定角色或泛稱保存，不補成員、姓名與親屬；擬立王及書名不當實際爵位授予。"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m010-0046","start":46,"end":50,"surface":"趙孝成王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004429","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m010-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"i